},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Umbrax Kilfey:14654:YELL:|h[|cff8788eeUmbrax Kilfey|r]|h yells: WTM |cnIQ1:|Hitem:10051::::::::50:1490:::1:3524::::::|h[Red Mageweave Bag]|h|r FREE with 25 |cnIQ1:|Hitem:4338::::::::50:1490:::::::::|h[Mageweave Cloth]|h|r. I provide the other mats. Get your bags upgraded for cheap.",
