["name"] = "Samantha Shackleton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Samantha Shackleton:15150:MONSTER_SAY:|h[Samantha Shackleton]|h says: [Gutterspeak] If I could just find \"Magic and the Ways of Power\". Ahh here it is, what was it doing over here?",
["timestamp"] = 1795145873,
["id"] = "s4_3187",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonwarlock-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Godrick Farsan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Godrick Farsan says: This is Dalin Forgewright. He fled from Lordaeron when the plague struck, taking his love with him.",
["timestamp"] = 1795145936,
["id"] = "s4_3188",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonwarlock-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Godrick Farsan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Godrick Farsan says: When he came upon the refugees at the Greymane Wall, he felt it his duty to succor them, sending his woman on to Hillsbrad.",
["timestamp"] = 1795145941,
["id"] = "s4_3189",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonwarlock-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Godrick Farsan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Godrick Farsan says: And this is Corma Villard. Two weeks married, her wife was spirited away from the safety of Menethil Harbor.",
["timestamp"] = 1795145947,
["id"] = "s4_3190",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonwarlock-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Godrick Farsan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Godrick Farsan says: Five and five years, and she still searches for her, though she was no beauty, and there were many ladies that would take her place.",
["timestamp"] = 1795145952,
["id"] = "s4_3191",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonwarlock-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Godrick Farsan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Godrick Farsan says: Fools.",
["timestamp"] = 1795145959,
["id"] = "s4_3192",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonwarlock-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
