["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Herald of Thrall yells: Honor your heroes! On this day, they have dealt a great blow against one of our most hated enemies! The false Warchief, Rend Blackhand, has fallen!",
