},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:7628::::::::5:1490:::::::::|h[Nondescript Letter]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2168\",\"timestamp\":1794097250},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:12737::::::::5:1490:::::::::|h[Gloom Weed]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2169\",\"timestamp\":1794097353},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:12737::::::::5:1490:::::::::|h[Gloom Weed]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2170\",\"timestamp\":1794097366},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:12737::::::::5:1490:::::::::|h[Gloom Weed]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2171\",\"timestamp\":1794097377},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Go on and have a seat near the fire and we can get started.\",\"id\":\"s0_2172\",\"timestamp\":1794097502},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: All you need to start a camp of your own is a basic campfire. Cooks can generally teach you how to make one of those.\",\"id\":\"s0_2173\",\"timestamp\":1794097507},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.\",\"id\":\"s0_2174\",\"timestamp\":1794097515},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Sufficiently skilled leatherworkers, for example, can place a tent like this one behind me.\",\"id\":\"s0_2175\",\"timestamp\":1794097521},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!\",\"id\":\"s0_2176\",\"timestamp\":1794097528},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.\",\"id\":\"s0_2177\",\"timestamp\":1794097533},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.\",\"id\":\"s0_2178\",\"timestamp\":1794097544},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.\",\"id\":\"s0_2179\",\"timestamp\":1794097552},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:279937::::::::6:1490:::::::::|h[Collecting Basket]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2180\",\"timestamp\":1794097632},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Junior Apothecary Holland\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Junior Apothecary Holland says: As if I had all eternity.\",\"id\":\"s0_2181\",\"timestamp\":1794097643},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:208185::::::::6:1490:::::::::|h[The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2182\",\"timestamp\":1794097682},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG