:0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Herald of Thrall yells: Honor your heroes! On this day, they have dealt a great blow against one of our most hated enemies! The false Warchief, Rend Blackhand, has fallen!\",\"id\":\"s2_3684\",\"timestamp\":1794896345},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonmage Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:269719::::::::17:1482:::::::::|h[Trapped Game]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s2_3685\",\"timestamp\":1794896347},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Herald of Thrall\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Herald of Thrall yells: Be bathed in the power of the Warchief! Drink in his might! Battle for the glory of the Horde!\",\"id\":\"s2_3686\",\"timestamp\":1794896349},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonmage Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:269718::::::::17:1482:::::::::|h[Bundle of Hides]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s2_3687\",\"timestamp\":1794896366},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: Watch your step making the climb up the ridge. It can be quite treacherous.\",\"id\":\"s2_3688\",\"timestamp\":1794896366},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Corporal Adamore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Corporal Adamore attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s2_3689\",\"timestamp\":1794896692},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonmage Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:270151::::::::17:1482:::::::::|h[Benedict's Orders]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s2_3690\",\"timestamp\":1794896720},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Copper\",\"id\":\"s2_3691\",\"timestamp\":1794896720},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: It looks like they've got Vrang with them. These bastards...\",\"id\":\"s2_3692\",\"timestamp\":1794896989},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: I thought you were dead, Terry.\",\"id\":\"s2_3693\",\"timestamp\":1794897002},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: No, Walt, I'm still alive. That shot you took at me back in Ratchet only missed my heart by an inch.\",\"id\":\"s2_3694\",\"timestamp\":1794897004},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Well, not much chance I'd miss at this range.\",\"id\":\"s2_3695\",\"timestamp\":1794897011},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: You might have failed to notice that you are outnumbered.\",\"id\":\"s2_3696\",\"timestamp\":1794897015},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Just so--no matter how fast these thugs are, my first shot is aimed at you.\",\"id\":\"s2_3697\",\"timestamp\":1794897018},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: It seems you've made some fast friends, Walt. This orc filth refused to give you up. If only he knew how little loyalty means to you.\",\"id\":\"s2_3698\",\"timestamp\":1794897023},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: It's not about loyalty. It's about honor. That orc knows more about honor than the Lord Admiral ever did. That's why I left.\",\"id\":\"s2_3699\",\"timestamp\":1794897031},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Listen to me, Terry, just take these men and leave. Tell Benedict or whomever sent you that I'm dead. Walk away.\",\"id\":\"s2_3700\",\"timestamp\":1794897038},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: I can't do that. You know what happens to deserters. Put your rifle down and come peacefully... or don't. The bounty is \\\"dead or alive\\\" and I still owe you for Ratchet.\",\"id\":\"s2_3701\",\"timestamp\":1794897045},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Dammit, Terry...\",\"id\":\"s2_3702\",\"timestamp\":1794897054},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink yells: Attack!\",\"id\":\"s2_3703\",\"timestamp\":1794897056},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Sorry if they roughed you up, Vrang. If I had known they got you, I'd have come running.\",\"id\":\"s2_3704\",\"timestamp\":1794897069},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: Is it true--you deserted your brothers in arms?\",\"id\":\"s2_3705\",\"timestamp\":1794897075},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Yes, Vrang, it is true. When Daelin Proudmoore took control of Theramore, he did terrible things. Dishonorable things that I could not be a part of.\",\"id\":\"s2_3706\",\"timestamp\":1794897080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: I see. I can respect a man who values his honor and does not compromise his convictions.\",\"id\":\"s2_3707\",\"timestamp\":1794897089},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Thank you, Vrang.\",\"id\":\"s2_3708\",\"timestamp\":1794897094},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: Lok-tar, Walton.\",\"id\":\"s2_3709\",\"timestamp\":1794897096},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_COLLECTED_APPEARANCE\",\"type\":\"COLLECTED_APPEARANCE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|cffff80ff|Htransmogappearance:304797|h[Keen Skinning Knife]|h|r has been added to your appearance collection.\",\"id\":\"s2_3710\",\"timestamp\":1794897112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_COLLECTED_APPEARANCE\",\"type\":\"COLLECTED_APPEARANCE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|cffff80ff|Hitem:269717|h[Wildgore Greatsword]|h|r has been added to your appearance collection.\",\"id\":\"s2_3711\",\"timestamp\":1794897112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonmage-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_COL