y an inch.\",\"id\":\"s3_3083\",\"timestamp\":1795108786},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Well, not much chance I'd miss at this range.\",\"id\":\"s3_3084\",\"timestamp\":1795108793},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: You might have failed to notice that you are outnumbered.\",\"id\":\"s3_3085\",\"timestamp\":1795108796},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You create: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:5512::::::::17:1490:::::::::|h[Minor Healthstone]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_3086\",\"timestamp\":1795108797},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Just so--no matter how fast these thugs are, my first shot is aimed at you.\",\"id\":\"s3_3087\",\"timestamp\":1795108800},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: It seems you've made some fast friends, Walt. This orc filth refused to give you up. If only he knew how little loyalty means to you.\",\"id\":\"s3_3088\",\"timestamp\":1795108805},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: It's not about loyalty. It's about honor. That orc knows more about honor than the Lord Admiral ever did. That's why I left.\",\"id\":\"s3_3089\",\"timestamp\":1795108813},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Listen to me, Terry, just take these men and leave. Tell Benedict or whomever sent you that I'm dead. Walk away.\",\"id\":\"s3_3090\",\"timestamp\":1795108820},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink says: I can't do that. You know what happens to deserters. Put your rifle down and come peacefully... or don't. The bounty is \\\"dead or alive\\\" and I still owe you for Ratchet.\",\"id\":\"s3_3091\",\"timestamp\":1795108826},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Dammit, Terry...\",\"id\":\"s3_3092\",\"timestamp\":1795108836},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terry Longdrink\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Terry Longdrink yells: Attack!\",\"id\":\"s3_3093\",\"timestamp\":1795108838},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul Tiras Marine\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul Tiras Marine attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s3_3094\",\"timestamp\":1795108855},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Sorry if they roughed you up, Vrang. If I had known they got you, I'd have come running.\",\"id\":\"s3_3095\",\"timestamp\":1795108859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: Is it true--you deserted your brothers in arms?\",\"id\":\"s3_3096\",\"timestamp\":1795108864},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Yes, Vrang, it is true. When Daelin Proudmoore took control of Theramore, he did terrible things. Dishonorable things that I could not be a part of.\",\"id\":\"s3_3097\",\"timestamp\":1795108869},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: I see. I can respect a man who values his honor and does not compromise his convictions.\",\"id\":\"s3_3098\",\"timestamp\":1795108878},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Walton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Walton says: Thank you, Vrang.\",\"id\":\"s3_3099\",\"timestamp\":1795108883},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vrang Wildgore\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vrang Wildgore says: Lok-tar, Walton.\",\"id\":\"s3_3100\",\"timestamp\":1795108885},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:269716::::::::17:1490::11:::::::|h[Keen Skinning Knife]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s3_3101\",\"timestamp\":1795108885},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You create: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2840::::::::17:1490:::::::::|h[Copper Bar]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_3102\",\"timestamp\":1795108938},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You create: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2840::::::::17:1490:::::::::|h[Copper Bar]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_3103\",\"timestamp\":1795108941},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Mining has increased to 60.\",\"id\":\"s3_3104\",\"timestamp\":1795108941},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonwarlock-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonwarlock Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"level\":17},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\"